    <string name="setup_check_howto_title">How to test</string>
    <string name="setup_check_howto_steps">1. Add the number of a second phone to the blacklist (button below).\n2. Make sure that number is not saved in your contacts, or turn off “Use contacts” for the test: numbers from contacts are never blocked.\n3. Call this phone from the second phone.\n4. The call should end right away, and the call log shows it as blocked.\n5. Afterwards remove the test entry from the blacklist.</string>
